lines:
As you can plainly see, there is not a
single painting on exhibit.{be01}
Here, I don’t wish to exhibit works of
so-called classical art.{be01}
Such classical works you can see on
our ground floor.{be01}
I wish to exhibit work that is far
different from the classics.{be01}
Art, after all, is not restricted to old,
famous works!{be01}
This exhibit hall, I wish to fill it with...{be01}
Modern and vibrant artworks of
Pokémon seemingly ready to spring{be00}
forth into glorious life!

I beg your pardon. I didn’t intend
to monopolize the conversation.{be01}
Now, as you are young, and yet
obviously well traveled...{be01}
You must encounter lively Pokémon
and works of art depicting them.{be01}
If you were to come across such a
painting, may we ask you to obtain{be00}
the artist’s permission to exhibit{be00}
it here?
